esent for her valentine and the  fragment of her tooth that it had rather  unceremoniously knocked out sighing she  leaned against the rear bumper of her  car keeping an eye on  scp-3832 while she waited for the  recovery team to arrive what a way to  spend valentine's day big sister thought  to herself worried about what her  partner would say when she got home late  with a chipped tooth then she noticed  something that while it didn't fix the  situation at least made her feel a  little less bad about it the post-it  note face of  scp-3832 had changed once again big  sister grabbed her phone from her pocket  to take a picture of it so she could  hand it over as evidence to the research  team instead of its normal frown  scribbled across the sticky note  scp-3832's hand-drawn expression had  become an almost bashful dimpled smile  with a big pair of cartoon hearts in its  eyes so if you take anything away from  this video it should be this gentle  reminder the chances of you being  ambushed and pounced upon by a pillow  with a post-it note for a face are well  statistically speaking the chances are  pretty slim but they're never zero  either you really should keep your wits  about you stay alert make sure you check  for movement when you leave every room  and look under tables and even in your  refrigerator just to be safe and if you  see something moving out of the corner  of your eye even just for a split second  then you too might just get hit in the  face by a pillow now why not go and  check out scp-999 the tickle monster and  scp-348 a gift from dad to get yourself  acquainted with a few of the more  adorable anomalies that the scp  foundation have encountered

