 the place for anyone to steal or for  scp-38  to hide behind on the 14th of february  saint valentine's day 2017. foundation  technicians had been working on  repairing a glitch that had been  disrupting  scp-3832's tracking tag it was during  that moment that the wily polyester  pillow teleported out of its locker at  site-64 once again vanishing and  reappearing in the trunk of a car  belonging to a member of personnel now  for security reasons the name of the  staff member has been censored letting  her retain her anonymity and probably  whatever is left of her dignity too  we'll just call her big sister which is  how the file on the highly classified  scp archive refers to her up until this  point the researchers at the scp  foundation have never known  scp-3832 to have the ability to teleport  itself into a moving vehicle  teleportation is hard enough at the best  of times seriously you try shifting  every atom of your body from one spot to  another without getting stuck in a wall  and yet the crafty cushion made the  switch effortlessly relocating itself  into the back of big sister's car  without her noticing and to her credit  she had other things on her mind she  just finished a long day's work at site  64 and she needed to pick something up  for a special someone it was valentine's  day after all as she drove away big  sister was completely oblivious to the  fact that  scp-3832 could apparently now teleport  itself into moving vehicles the research  team studying the pillow and even the  security staff she passed at the front  gate were equally unaware making her way  further and further from site 64 big  sister pulled onto the freeway nervously  checking her watch she desperately hoped  she could get there in time before the  factory closed and that they'd still  have a box left they had to right who  sells out of chocolate on valentine's  day it's their biggest sales day of the  year safe for perhaps easter sunday  getting closer to saint john's chocolate  factory big sister could see from a  distance that the lights were still on  she relaxed in the driver's seat  breathing a sigh of relief that she'd  made it in good time her thoughts  quickly turned to her sweetheart  imagining the look of delight on their  face when she got home and presented  them with a shiny heart-shaped box  filled with a delicious assortment of  confectionaries parking up she dashed  inside the last person in before closing  time little did she know what was still  lurking in the trunk of her car like the  urban legend of the axe wielding killer  in the back seat with her romantic  holiday gesture of a box of chocolates  all paid for and tucked securely under  her arm big sister made her way back to  the car then a thought struck her a  terrible thought she couldn't just leave  this in the car the surprise would be  totally ruined if her significant other  could see what she'd got for them there  was only one thing for it the box of  chocolates needed to be hidden when she  got home and where else do you think to  hide something in a car in the trunk of  course as big sister unlocked the back  and lifted up the trunk lid a concealed  cushioned stealth attack of pure pillow  force struck her  scp-3832 launched itself from its hiding  place only to collide with the box that  big sis was carrying catching her  completely by surprise making its  signature squeak the predatory pillow  knocked the box sharply upwards into the  air and in a cruel twist of fate sent  the pointed edge of the heart straight  into big sister's face the tapered tip  was propelled straight into her mouth  chipping her front tooth as  scp-3832 landed on the ground of the  parking lot it was the most brutally  violent attack that  scp-3832 had ever conducted shocking  everyone at the scp foundation with a  cheer wonton ferocity making a call to  the scp foundation big sister requested  a recovery team to come and collect the  troublesome cushion after picking up the  present for her valentine and the  fragment of her tooth that it had rather  unceremoniously knocked out sighing she  leaned against the rear bumper of her  car keeping an eye on  scp-3832 while she waited for the  recovery team to arrive what a way to  spend valentine's day big sister thought  to herself worried about what her  partner would say when she got home late  with a chipped tooth then she noticed  something that while it didn't fix the  situation at least made her feel a  little less bad about it the post-it  note face of  scp-3832 had changed once again big  sister grabbed her phone from her pocket  to take a picture of it so she could  hand it over as evidence to the research  team instead of its normal frown  scribbled across the sticky note  scp-3832's hand-drawn expression had  become an almost bashful dimpled smile  with a big pair of cartoon hearts in its  eyes so if you take anything away from  this video it should be this gentle  reminder the chances of you being  ambushed and pounced upon by a pillow  with a post-it note for a face are well  statistically speaking the chances are  pretty slim but they're never zero  either you really should keep your wits  about you stay alert make sure you check  for movement when you leave every room  and look under tables and even in your  refrigerator just to be safe and if you  see something moving out of the corner  of your eye even just for a split second  then you too might just get hit in the  face by a pillow now why not go and  check out scp-999 the tickle monster and  scp-348 a gift from dad to get yourself  acquainted with a few of the more  adorable anomalies that the scp  foundation have encountered
 

